0 seconds are dropped.\"},{\"text\":\"The Vandrell Relay allows a response 120 seconds to arrive before it times out.\",\"line\":9,\"span\":\"The relay allows a response 120 seconds to arrive before it times out.\"},{\"text\":\"The Vandrell Relay allows at most 512 connections to be held open concurrently.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"At most 512 connections may be held open concurrently.\"},{\"text\":\"The Vandrell Relay makes up to 3 further attempts after a request fails.\",\"line\":14,\"span\":\"The relay makes up to 3 further attempts after a request fails.\"},{\"text\":\"The Vandrell Relay will not negotiate any protocol version below TLS 1.2.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"The relay will not negotiate any protocol version below TLS 1.2.\"},{\"text\":\"The Vandrell Relay emits access log records one JSON object per line.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"Access log records are emitted one JSON object per line.\"},{\"text\":\"The Vandrell Relay endpoint /-/healthy answers health checks.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"The endpoint /-/healthy answers health checks.\"}]}","ttft_ms":2091,"type":"result","duration_ms":5713,"uuid":"6609270f-654d-48f5-8eee-5ba8b35cf4fd","ttft_stream_ms":1482,"time_to_request_ms":93,"first_content_frame_ms":1482,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
